      "description": "The app or EHR the health worker uses: renders the DAK's forms, extracts their resources, applies the DAK's decision tables (PlanDefinitions) and writes what the health worker accepted. Decides nothing clinical. A DAK's own systems (a CHW app, a clinic EHR) carry these skills or inherit this role.",
